a\" lang=\"ja\">げんじつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">现实；实际；事实</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">決</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>决定；约定；确定；判定；敲定</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">き.める・-ぎ.め・き.まる・さ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">決まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">被决定；被确定；被安排；保持不变；与往常相同；固定；既定；成为固定规则；注定；成为惯例；成为习俗；众所周知；（运动、游戏等中的动作）执行得很好；进展顺利；成功；（拳击）击中并命中；（衣服）看起来好看；看起来整洁；时尚；适合；（发型）保持到位；（歌舞伎中的姿态）摆出并保持；（吸毒后）变得兴奋；产生快感</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">決める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">决定</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">決して</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けっして</span><span class=\"k-wz\">决不；绝不；毫不；一点也不</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">全</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>全部；完全；整个；完成；所有</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゼン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まった.く・すべ.て</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">全部</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜんぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">全部；全；整个；总共</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">安全</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安全；保障</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">全</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">全；整体；完全；整个；完整；泛-；全套；总共</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">