.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">公務員</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうむいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公务员；政府雇员；公职人员；公共部门职员</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">事務所</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じむしょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">办公室；事务所</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">義務</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">义务；责任；职责</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">成</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>成为；变成；完成；达到；成长</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">な.る・な.す・-な.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">完成</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；完善；成就</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">構成</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">构成；组成；形成；构造；结构；组织</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">賛成</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赞成；同意；支持；赞许</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">期</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>时期；期间；期限；日期；期望</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ・ゴ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">延期</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">延期；推迟；展期</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">学期</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がっき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">学期</spa