a\" lang=\"ja\">つごう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">方便与否；情况</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">首都</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">首都；国都；京城；大都会</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">和</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>和谐；和平；柔和；日本式；混合</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ワ・オ・カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やわ.らぐ・やわ.らげる・なご.む・なご.やか・あ.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">平和</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へいわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">和平；和谐</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">英和</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えいわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">英日（双语）；英和词典；英日词典</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">漢和</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">中国和日本；汉语和日语；汉和词典；汉字词典</span></li></ul></div></li>"]